    lean: { kind: 'keep one', text: 'Keep custody receipt, draft 2, with Until\'s list format inside it. It is already the merge, in its prose: its act lines still name draft 1 (see the faults), so until they name the draft, "one text now" is true of the prose and not of the acts written under it. Its "set commitment" gap is for the MOR lead (section 4).' },
